+# SELF-CHECK-PIVOT (analysis/semantic_guard/, not upstream vLLM, not part of
+# Xia et al.'s taxonomy). Periodic, budget-aware self-assessment + reactive
+# pivot, built after this investigation established: (1) spec-casc-tok-
+# force-commit (the "never commits" fix) recovers tokens but not a correct
+# answer -- it truncates the waste rather than avoiding it; (2) FIVE
+# independently-designed structural/statistical signals (window-entropy
